  "flown_min_sep": "both tracks resampled onto the union of their native POS times, then the exact minimum of the piecewise-linear relative position per interval; violation = horizontal < 100 m AND vertical < 50 m with both above 2 m AGL",
  "time_above": "linear interpolation of the level crossings, not sample counting"
 },
